Routes are in `D:\code\tutors\src\routes\(course-reader)\`:

| Route pattern | Content type |
|---|---|
| `course/[courseid]` | Course home page |
| `topic/[courseid]/[...loid]` | Topic view |
| `lab/[courseid]/[...loid]` | Lab view |
